  "notes": "Schedule 1 line 10 v3. Equals closed unemployment (line 7) plus closed Form W-2G gambling winnings (line 8b) when every Form 1099-K loss reason is supported-loss or no box 1a member is present; otherwise blocks on tax.us.2025.f1099k.unresolved. The 'no other Schedule 1 income' answer of v2 (schedule1-part1-scope.no-sch1-other-income) is replaced on both paths by w2g-scope.no-sch1-other-income-except-w2g, which excepts recorded Form W-2G winnings; that answer is asked afresh. Winnings without a Form W-2G and business gambling are refused by that answer, and gambling losses by the declaration read in rule.w2g-b1-subtotal. The inert path is the unwritten second path rule-artifact.v14 requires. v2 remains historical."
}
